ref: TASK-153
---
Move recording buffer realloc out of audio thread.

Pre-allocate recording buffer at record-start (e.g., 10 min at 44100 Hz stereo = ~200MB).
Fail gracefully if exceeded. Remove realloc from sq_engine_process().

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] No malloc/realloc/free calls in sq_engine_process()
- [ ] Recording buffer pre-allocated when recording starts
- [ ] Max recording duration enforced (configurable, default 10 min)
- [ ] Status bar shows recording time remaining
- [ ] Graceful stop when buffer is full

## Test Plan
- [ ] Unit test: start recording, verify buffer allocated
- [ ] Unit test: fill buffer to capacity, verify graceful stop
- [ ] ASan run: no heap operations in audio callback path
